  "extractionNotes": "Proof of stillbirth is the special doctor/midwife certificate issued when no registry act exists (sex undetermined); no birth act in the file. Granted period printed on the ZUS benefit screen (56 days, 100%) and in a handwritten ZUS note. Application date not legible; asOf set to the event date. The Z-3 salary table is printed for 2023-12..2024-11 while the sick pay and the event are dated 2026; the table is the 12 months before the first incapacity (sick pay from 2026-06-09), so month labels were shifted by +18 months to 2025-06..2026-05. Constant salary 5091.05; two months with a few sickness days. Etat fraction not legible. The employer ticked the wrong benefit box on the Z-3; ZUS paid the correct benefit. Base and amounts not printed."
